00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:06.990
- [Johnny] There are bunkers

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:08.377
everywhere in this country.

00:00:08.377 --> 00:00:10.960
- [Radio Controller] Mayday,
mayday, mayday, slowing down.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.443
(radio controller speaking
faintly) slowing down.

00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:15.840
- [Announcer] Nevertheless,
their objective remains

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.019
