of the largest bunker

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:36.840
in all of Switzerland.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.910
It is massive.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.013
I mean, look at this place.
(Johnny chuckles)

00:00:41.013 --> 00:00:44.820
(gentle ominous music)

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.070
30,000 square meters of space,

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:49.770
