00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.397
who currently owns the bunker.

00:00:56.397 --> 00:00:59.250
- This is where the crew
was taking the showers,

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.530
showering 85 meters of rock above you.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.090
- [Johnny] Yeah, it's gotta be

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:04.800
