army from the north.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.380
Oh, and it's not just the mountains.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.750
I also discovered hundreds
of thousands of bunkers

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.550
dug under Swiss homes,

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:44.430
a further expression of
the Swiss habit of digging

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:45.780
to remain neutral.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.700
The bunkers are at the
center of a discussion

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.820
that is heating up as the
world becomes dangerous again.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:52.650
So Switzerland is once again debating

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:54.390
what these bunkers mean to them

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:56.520
and what it means to be safe, secure,

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.782
and neutral in a changing world.

