00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:04.830
By the 1800s,

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.340
the Swiss were really good
at digging into mountains,

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.930
building cable cars, trains.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.640
They just, they got really good.

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:12.900
And that prowess for digging

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.540
became incredibly useful in the 1940s

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:18.120
when their situation looked like this.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.710
Surrounded by fascist regimes

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:22.680
