Europe very effectively,

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.780
these two allies, Italy and Germany,

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.000
with Switzerland kind of
sandwiched right in the middle.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.580
Neutral Switzerland wanted
to stay out of the war.

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:30.630
So they did whatever it took.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:31.860
But one of the major things they did

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.572
when they wanted to stay neutral,
was they started digging.

00:08:34.572 --> 00:08:37.989
(dramatic pulsing music)

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:43.620
They turned their mountains
into a literal giant fortress.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.640
Yes, you heard me right.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.950
They turned their
mountains into a fortress,

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.000
