00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.240
Redoubt just means,

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.710
basically an impenetrable fortress

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.000
that is dug into the ground,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.600
