like this, one fortress.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.420
Switzerland wanted to turn
their entire Alpine region,

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:03.900
which is a huge part of their
country, into a giant redoubt.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.630
I'm gonna explain to you the
strategy in just a second,

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:07.920
what the thinking was here,

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.120
because it's a little paradoxical

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.650
and weird and war is weird,

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:11.670
but the point is here

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.500
that they started digging and digging,

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.930
and started creating what
one historian has called

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:18.022
the biggest fortress in Europe.

